Slots, row-major:
row1: (0) armless/legless horse torso horizontal oval with natural shoulders, no head/neck/legs; (1) separate HORSE HEAD only, nose to RIGHT, ears and eyes, rounded back of cheek, no neck; (2) hind upper leg muscular vertical with circular rounded hip cap and rounded knee cap, smooth chestnut; (3) hind lower leg vertical straight dark limb, rounded at both ends, NO hoof;
row2: (4) isolated black horse HOOF side view facing RIGHT, rounded short ankle top centered over rear quarter; (5) separate elegant horse NECK with attached short black mane, vertical/up-right, full rounded base bottom and small rounded head attachment top, no face; (6) long BLACK TAIL HAIR flowing down-left, rounded root top-right; (7) front upper leg chestnut vertical, softly rounded shoulder and knee caps;
row3: (8) front lower leg black vertical, softly rounded caps, NO hoof; (9) small extra dark hoof alternate right-facing; (10) small chestnut knee pad rounded; (11) chestnut shoulder patch oval;
row4: (12) black mane strand separate; (13) small chestnut muzzle rounded; (14) chestnut belly patch oval; (15) chestnut hip patch oval.
Draw whole parts within each cell, no overlaps. Soft neutral illumination consistent between parts. Alpha background genuinely transparent. Art must stay natural, healthy, expressive; construction radii are internal, not visible robot hardware.
